; Pure structural validation and deterministic planning for the inference
; comparison coordinator: endpoint graph indexes, complete-partition and
; boundary checks, correspondence and recipe checks, the union dependency
; order and value lifetimes. No engine, compiler, Unix or libtorch dependency:
; it consumes the schema layer and the codec layer's recipe checker only.
; Planning performs no inference, so a malformed mapping fails here before any
; runner exists. See .ai/ (the inference comparison schema layer).

(library
 (name inference_compare_plan)
 (libraries err_trace fmt inference_compare_codecs inference_compare_schema))
